@startuml
queue "Kafka route" as Q
participant EventHub as H
participant DeliveryStartedHandler as D
database MongoDB
participant "Goroutine + channel" as Ch
queue "Kafka simulation" as S
Q -> H : DeliveryStarted
H -> D : handleDeliveryStarted
D -> MongoDB : buscar Route
D -> Ch : enviar coordenadas / 1s
Ch -> H : DriverMoved
H -> S : publicar ponto
note right of Ch
Pausa de 1s e timeout de 500ms
exigem teste contra perda de eventos.
end note
@enduml
